  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dev of local dem in Kgrd3</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utv av lok dem i Kgrd 3</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ett samarbete mellan Svenska Kommunf&#xF6;rbundet och Kaliningrads Borgm&#xE4;steri f&#xF6;r att st&#xE4;rka det lokala sj&#xE4;lvstyret. Projektet &#xE4;r upp- delat i sex delprojekt. M&#xE5;len &#xE4;r bl a att st&#xE4;rka de valda politikernasroll, att st&#xF6;dja Kaliningrads Borgm&#xE4;steri och att utveckla en kommunalbudgetprocess.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support by The Swedish Association of Local Authorities to the development of local governments in the Kaliningrad region within six different subprojects. The objectives are i.a. to strengthen the roles of the elected representatives, to support the Kaliningrad counterpart and to develop the budget process at municipal level.</narrative>
  </description>
